OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786303106
OL,3,CBody of man found in burning car in
OL,4,CPortadown
OL,6,FThe body of a man has been found
OL,7,Finside a burning car in Portadown.
OL,9,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,10,FHarford Street area on Saturday night.
OL,12,FThe man was pronounced dead at the
OL,13,Fscene and a post-mortem examination is
OL,14,Fdue to take place.
OL,16,FSignificant damage was caused to the
OL,17,Fcar.
OL,19,FA number of windows were smashed and
OL,20,Fscorch damage was caused to a nearby
OL,21,Fproperty.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/6
