OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786303106
OL,3,CBody of man found in burning car in
OL,4,CPortadown
OL,6,FPSNI Chief Inspector Tierney said: "At
OL,7,Fapproximately 10pm on Saturday
OL,8,Fevening, 8th August we received a
OL,9,Freport of a car on fire in the Harford
OL,10,FStreet area of the town.
OL,12,F"Officers attended alongside
OL,13,Fcolleagues from the Northern Ireland
OL,14,FFire and Rescue Service who
OL,15,Fextinguished the fire.
OL,17,F"Ammunition Technical Officers (ATO)
OL,18,Fwere also tasked to the scene to
OL,19,Fconduct relevant enquiries ` we can
OL,20,Fconfirm there is no risk to the public.
OL,26,@nD@dOUtD@AOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/6
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,413,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786303106
OL,3,CBody of man found in burning car in
OL,4,CPortadown
OL,6,F"Significant damage was caused to the
OL,7,Fcar, as well as a number of windows
OL,8,Fsmashed and scorch damage observed to
OL,9,Fa neighbouring property in the area.
OL,11,F"Sadly, we can confirm the body of a
OL,12,Fman was located inside the vehicle. He
OL,13,Fwas pronounced deceased at the scene `
OL,14,Fand a post-mortem examination will be
OL,15,Fcarried out in due course to determine
OL,16,Fthe cause of death.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/6
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,413,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786303106
OL,3,CBody of man found in burning car in
OL,4,CPortadown
OL,6,F"The circumstances surrounding what
OL,7,Fhappened are still under
OL,8,Finvestigation, and enquiries are
OL,9,Fongoing to determine the cause of the
OL,10,Ffire."
OL,12,FDUP MP for Upper Bann Carla Lockhart
OL,13,Fdescribed the incident as "deeply
OL,14,Ftragic news".
OL,16,F"My thoughts and prayers are with the
OL,17,Ffamily and loved ones of the deceased.
OL,18,FBehind this news is a family facing
OL,19,Fthe most devastating circumstances,
OL,20,Fand they should be very much in our
OL,21,Fthoughts this morning.
OL,26,@nD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/6
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
