PN,41205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786303106
OL,3,CBody of man found in burning car in
OL,4,CPortadown
OL,6,FMs Lockhart paid tribute to the
OL,7,Femergency services who would have
OL,8,Fwitnessed an "extremely difficult
OL,9,Fscene".
OL,11,F"It is extremely important that the
OL,12,FPSNI are given the time and space
OL,13,Fnecessary to carry out a full and
OL,14,Fthorough investigation," she added.
OL,16,F"I would appeal to everyone to please
OL,17,Favoid speculation on social media,
OL,18,Fparticularly around the identity of
OL,19,Fthe deceased or the circumstances
OL,20,Fsurrounding what has happened."
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/6
